Package: omakasui-devtools
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, jq, imagemagick, python3-pil
Recommends: bash-completion
Replaces: omakub-devtools (<< 0.0.3~), omadeb-devtools (<< 0.0.3~)
Breaks: omakub-devtools (<< 0.0.3~), omadeb-devtools (<< 0.0.3~)
Description: Development tooling for Omakasui environments (shared payload)
 Provides the devtools command-line dispatcher and helper scripts used by
 developers working across Omakasui environments: theme asset generation,
 preview formatting, and related build tooling. Install omakub-devtools or
 omadeb-devtools to get the project-specific command name.
 Not intended for end-user installation.

Package: omakub-devtools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, omakasui-devtools (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Development tooling for Omabuntu environments
 Provides the omakub-devtools command. Not intended for end-user installation.

